  "name": "SIGNALS",
  "family": "special",
  "layout": "STUDIO_CONSOLE",
  "description": "SIGNALS / SKIN-001: independent graphite-and-brushed-metal console skin with restrained cyan/electric-blue neon accents, left preset browser, guitar graffiti hero, nine illuminated metal rotary controls, AMP & TONE module, seven-effect FX chain, full-width MIDI keyboard and bottom performance/status strip. Visual-only theme; preserves all native control bindings.",
