  "notes": [
    "Independent selectable theme slot SKIN-001 / SIGNALS. Never replace, rename or repurpose SKIN-053 / NEON STAGE DEFAULT.",
    "Art direction is based on the user's supplied reference mockup 01 INTERFACE NEON STAGE DEFAULT.png; create original SIGNALS artwork rather than copying the reference image as a finished skin.",
    "Keep the 27 required control IDs plus sync_selector metadata and all runtime bindings from the REV.20 control schema.",
    "Visual-only: no APVTS, DSP, sampler, MIDI, preset, parameter-ID, or audio callback changes.",
    "Do not mark runtime-ready until registry, ThemeManager/gallery, packaging, validators, CI, Windows x64 build and CTest all include the 17th theme."
  ]
